    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"727421\">Alastair Irving</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/Field.20failure/near/615437803\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Probably the issue is that field_simp can't make progress without knowing the denominators are nonzero even though that isn't needed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Can’t swear it but that’d be my guess as well.</p>",
